msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 100.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Combo Action: </ui-edge-color></ui-color><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Split Shot</ui-edge-color></ui-color> or <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Heated Split Shot</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Combo Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>210<if ($gn68 == 31)><if ($gn72 >= 30)><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Combo Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Increases <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Heat Gauge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 5</if></if>"
