msgid "Binds target.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s (PvP 8s)<br>Cancels auto-attack upon execution.<br>Shares a recast timer with <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Leg Graze</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
