msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 80.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Hypercharge Potency:<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505> 120<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Hypercharge Effect:<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505> Increases target's physical damage taken by 5%<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 10s"
